<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Sovereign Oracle - Blueprint Presentation</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@400;700&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* --- CORE AESTHETICS --- */
        :root {
            --obsidian: #0A0A0B;
            --gold: #D4AF37;
            --violet-glow: rgba(45, 27, 78, 0.6);
            --text-white: #F8F9FA;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--obsidian);
            color: var(--text-white);
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 60px;
        }

        /* --- ANIMATIONS --- */
        @keyframes pulse-gold {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.6); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2); }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-15px); }
            100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
        }

        @keyframes rotate-slow {
            from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* --- SLIDE CONTAINER --- */
        .slide {
            width: 1000px;
            height: 600px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1a1a2e 0%, var(--obsidian) 80%);
            border: 1px solid #333;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        /* --- TYPOGRAPHY --- */
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel Decorative', serif;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 64px; text-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }
        h2 { font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold); padding-bottom: 10px; }
        p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 800px; text-align: center; color: #ccc; z-index: 10; }
        
        .accent-text { color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold; }

        /* --- VISUAL ELEMENTS (CSS GRAPHICS) --- */
        
        /* The Gold Sigil */
        .sigil-graphic {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border: 2px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: absolute;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            animation: pulse-gold 4s infinite;
        }
        .sigil-inner {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            animation: rotate-slow 20s linear infinite;
        }

        /* The Violet Orbs */
        .orb {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(200, 200, 255, 0.8), var(--violet-glow));
            position: absolute;
            filter: blur(8px);
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        
        /* Orb Positions for Slide 1 */
        .orb-1 { top: 20%; left: 20%; animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
        .orb-2 { bottom: 20%; right: 20%; animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 1s; }
        .orb-3 { top: 20%; right: 20%; animation: float 8s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 2s; }
        .orb-4 { bottom: 20%; left: 20%; animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 0.5s; }

        /* --- LAYOUTS --- */
        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            width: 80%;
            margin-top: 40px;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .card h3 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; }

        .quote-box {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 28px;
            color: var(--text-white);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
            padding-left: 30px;
            margin: 40px;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- SLIDE 1: TITLE -->
    <div class="slide">
        <!-- Background Orbs -->
        <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
        <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
        <div class="orb orb-3"></div>
        <div class="orb orb-4"></div>
        
        <!-- Central Sigil -->
        <div class="sigil-graphic">
            <div class="sigil-inner"></div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 200px; z-index: 10;">
            <h1>The Sovereign Oracle</h1>
            <p style="letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--gold); margin-top: 10px;">ARCHITECTED BY CHELSEA</p>
            <p>A Sanctuary of Spiritual Intelligence & Legacy</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SLIDE 2: THE VISION -->
    <div class="slide">
        <h2>The Vision</h2>
        <p>In a world of generic noise, we provide <span class="accent-text">Scary Accurate</span> intelligence.</p>
        <p>The Sovereign Oracle bridges ancient Pythagorean Numerology with modern 3D technology to create a digital mirror for the soul. This is not just an app; it is a legacy project built with protective integrity.</p>
        
        <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Smart Logic</h3>
                <p>Calculates "Soul DNA" using exact birth coordinates.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>3D Sanctuary</h3>
                <p>Immersive visual environment (Obsidian & Gold).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Legacy</h3>
                <p>Dedicated to Mckenzie & Jaeden Lyman.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SLIDE 3: THE USER JOURNEY -->
    <div class="slide">
        <h2>The User Journey</h2>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 40px; align-items: center; z-index: 10;">
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; border: 2px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 50%; line-height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 10px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold;">1</div>
                <p style="font-size: 14px;">ENTRY<br>Name & Birthdate</p>
            </div>

            <div style="width: 100px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold);"></div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; border: 2px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 50%; line-height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 10px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold;">2</div>
                <p style="font-size: 14px;">REVEAL<br>Instant Soul DNA</p>
            </div>

            <div style="width: 100px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold);"></div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; border: 2px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 50%; line-height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 10px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold;">3</div>
                <p style="font-size: 14px;">GIFT<br>60-Page Map</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SLIDE 4: THE LEGACY -->
    <div class="slide">
        <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
        <div class="quote-box">
            "I built this with the same protective ferocity and integrity I hold for my children, Mckenzie & Jaeden."
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold;">— CHELSEA, THE ARCHITECT</p>
    </div>

    <!-- SLIDE 5: LAUNCH 2026 -->
    <div class="slide">
        <div class="sigil-graphic" style="width: 300px; height: 300px; opacity: 0.1;"></div>
        <h1>2026</h1>
        <p>THE GATE OPENS</p>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--gold); padding: 10px 40px; color: var(--gold);">
            THE SOVEREIGN ORACLE
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
